# Testing

Required suites: unit, integration, API, database, provider, strategy, simulation, backtest, security, frontend.

Importing a module is not a passing test.

Live API tests must hit the real endpoint when the network allows. If a key is missing, assert schema + error handling + rate-limit mapping — never fake a successful market snapshot.

Do not skip tests to make CI green. If a source is down, the test documents the outage via SourceStatus.

Backtest tests must prove no future peeking (shuffle timestamps / leak features and expect failure).
